{"id":"n91737-3-4","stage":1,"title":"힘들다 · 费心","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n91737-3-4-1","ko":"너 아직도 마음이 힘들어? 표정이 안 좋네.","zh":"你还是心里很难过吗？表情看起来不太好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"마음이","meaning":"心情，心绪","explanation":"마음：心情，心绪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"마음","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20911","senseId":"3","lemma":"마음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마음이","audio":"/audio/82961fdb31e01cd27c53.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어?","meaning":"费心，用心，费苦心","explanation":"힘들다：费心，用心，费苦心；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"3","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어","audio":"/audio/42a96966a9378057f47c.mp3"}},{"text":"표정이","meaning":"表情，脸色","explanation":"표정：表情，脸色；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"표정","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72390","senseId":"1","lemma":"표정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"표정이","audio":"/audio/2d218cca6da1e76d9077.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋네.","meaning":"好，高兴，愉快","explanation":"좋다：好，高兴，愉快；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"11","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋네","audio":"/audio/706ff3c687e3893095c5.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"aa9cbf25b5381e2c","term":"마음","zh":"心情，心绪","audio":"/audio/aa9cbf25b5381e2c30cd.mp3","entryId":"20911","definition":"情绪或感受。","pronunciation":["마음"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"费心，用心，费苦心","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"有用心思或费力气的一面。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]},{"id":"fb140081bcc182e5","term":"표정","zh":"表情，脸色","audio":"/audio/fb140081bcc182e51a4d.mp3","entryId":"72390","definition":"心中的情感或想法等表露在脸上；或指那样的模样。","pronunciation":["표정"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，高兴，愉快","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"感情等很愉悦、很满足。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bd5b9017194232550fd1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n91737-3-4-2","ko":"응. 괜찮아지려고 노력하는데 잘 안되네.","zh":"嗯。我在努力让自己好起来，但就是不太顺利呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아지려고","meaning":"无恙，没事；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아지려고","audio":"/audio/04d4d44545035cc22cbc.mp3"}},{"text":"노력하는데","meaning":"努力，下工夫","explanation":"노력하다：努力，下工夫；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"노력하다","audio":"/audio/365865908c0122f41532.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64375","senseId":"1","lemma":"노력하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노력하는데","audio":"/audio/762f5806a15b961f919e.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"容易","explanation":"잘：容易","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"14","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"안되네.","meaning":"不称心，不顺","explanation":"안되다：不称心，不顺；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"안되다","audio":"/audio/988ac8e2982c41f4e0c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73915","senseId":"1","lemma":"안되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안되네","audio":"/audio/4a26b97fcd77f8c0e4ec.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"365865908c0122f4","term":"노력하다","zh":"努力，下工夫","audio":"/audio/365865908c0122f41532.mp3","entryId":"64375","definition":"为达到某种目的而尽心尽力。","pronunciation":["노려카다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"容易","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"性质或倾向较易成为某种状态或进行某种行动地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"988ac8e2982c41f4","term":"안되다","zh":"不称心，不顺","audio":"/audio/988ac8e2982c41f4e0c8.mp3","entryId":"73915","definition":"某事情或现象的结果不好。","pronunciation":["안되다","안뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4df58650de9a4383689.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=91737","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":46,"sequenceScore":2.0318,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你看起来很开心，已经完全不难过了啊。","你还是心里很难过吗？表情看起来不太好啊。","你的身体看起来好像已经完全恢复了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我已经不想再努力，打算放弃了。","我没做任何努力，心情却已经好了。","嗯。我在努力让自己好起来，但就是不太顺利呢。"],"answer":2}]}
